<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46350" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Sucro</span></b> , ōnis, m.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A river of</i> Hispania Tarraconensis, now the <i>Xucar</i>, <i><span class="en">Mel. 2, 6</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 3, 3,
				4, § 20</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A town at the mouth of this river</i>, now <i>Sueca</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 3, 3, 4, § 20</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Liv. 28,
			24</span></i>; <i><span class="en">28, 26</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">28, 29</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Sen.
				Ben. 5, 24, 1</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Flor. 3, 22, 7</span></i>. — Hence,
				<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Sucrō-nensis</span></b> ,
				e, adj., <i>of</i> or
				<i>pertaining to Sucro</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">proelium,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. Balb. 2</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sinus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mel.
					2, 6, 7</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">2, 7,
			21</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>III.</b>
			<i>An island near the coast of Spain</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 3, 5,
				11, § 76</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>The name of a Rutulian</i>, <i><span class="en">Verg. A.
				12, 505</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
